            </div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#252A29]/60 dark:text-neutral-400 bg-[#F8F8F5] dark:bg-neutral-950 px-4 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-[#EAEAE4] dark:border-white/5">
              https://lexvanguard.legal
