            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-[#252A29]/60 dark:text-neutral-400 pt-2">
              <span>Turnos virtuales vía Google Meet</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-[#8A3D28] dark:text-red-400">Ver Agenda →</span>
